    "title": "2 friends tell me the Varoufakis video is a deepfake.",
    "text": "2 friends tell me the Varoufakis video is a deepfake.\nHowever, I am not sure the message is far off from reality. Look at the moves in gold and silver. Look at the way Trump has tried one scheme after another to prop up the dollar. Look at the speed with which the globalists are moving, trying to beat some clodk—and a monetary collapse seems the most likely thing they are racing against. Look at the difficulties we have with many foreign central banks trying to rid themselves (and already have to a great extent) of our currency.\nThe bankers can stave things off for a long time—look, it has been 17 years since 2008—and they can keep wringing more and more out of us peasants. But for how long? Best to be prepared.",
